==Trivia==
*Kaoru Hanayama's single knockback, several immunities and long foreswing may be a reference to his first fight in ''Baki the Grappler'', where fighter Tommy Carbine hits him multiple times while he prepares to attack, only for Hanayama to have no reaction.

